  "onboardingWelcomeTitle": "Welcome",
  "onboardingWelcomeBody": "Read, recite and memorise the Quran, at your own pace. No ads, no account, no interruptions.",
  "onboardingWelcomeDedication": "This application is dedicated to the memory of my father. May Allah have mercy on him and forgive him. And may He make the recitation and learning of His Book easy for each of you.",
  "onboardingReadTitle": "Read the Quran",
  "onboardingReadBody": "The complete Mushaf, with tajweed colours so you can see the rules as you read. Listen to the reciter of your choice, and drop a bookmark to pick up where you left off.",
  "onboardingReadHint": "Three reading moods: light, restful sepia, or black background for night-time.",
  "onboardingReciteTitle": "Recite and be corrected",
  "onboardingReciteBody": "Recite out loud: the app listens and colours each word as you go. Green means the word is right; orange or red means it deserves another look.",
  "onboardingReciteHint": "Drawing a blank? The prompter plays the expected word for you, no judgement.",
  "onboardingMemorizeTitle": "Memorise through play",
  "onboardingMemorizeBody": "The memorisation game has you rebuild the text word by word. The round does not stop at the end of a page: it carries on as long as you keep going.",
  "onboardingMemorizeHint": "Your personal record of consecutive words is kept from one round to the next.",
  "onboardingCoachTitle": "Your coach",
  "onboardingCoachBody": "After each recitation, find what went wrong: the flagged words, your own voice on each of them, and the reciter's reading to compare.",
  "onboardingCoachHint": "Mistakes are grouped by surah and by tajweed rule, so you can see what keeps coming back.",
  "onboardingDuasTitle": "Supplications and prayer",
  "onboardingDuasBody": "Everyday supplications, with their audio and repetition counts. Prayer times calculated for your location, the adhan, and the direction of the Qibla.",
  "onboardingPrivacyTitle": "Your data stays with you",
  "onboardingPrivacyBody": "Your recitation is analysed on the device and never sent anywhere. No account, no ads, no trackers. The network is only used to download the recitations you ask for.",
  "duaPourNousTileTitle": "A supplication for us",
  "duaPourNousTileSubtitle": "This application is given freely, with no ads",
  "duaPourNousTitle": "A supplication",
  "duaPourNousIntro": "This application was written to make reciting and learning the Quran easier for you.",
  "duaPourNousAskTitle": "If it helps you",
  "duaPourNousAskBody": "Make a supplication for my late father and for my family.",
  "duaPourNousDeceasedArabic": "اللَّهُمَّ اغْفِرْ لَهُ وَارْحَمْهُ، وَعَافِهِ وَاعْفُ عَنْهُ، وَأَكْرِمْ نُزُلَهُ، وَوَسِّعْ مُدْخَلَهُ",
  "duaPourNousDeceasedTranslation": "O Allah, forgive him and have mercy on him, keep him safe and pardon him; honour his resting place and make his entrance wide.",
  "duaPourNousDeceasedSource": "Reported by Muslim",
  "duaPourNousForYouTitle": "And for you",
  "duaPourNousForYouBody": "May Allah make the recitation of His Book easy for you, firmly establish its memorisation in your heart, accept your effort, and make this Quran the spring of your heart and the light of your breast.",
  "duaPourNousForYouArabic": "اللَّهُمَّ اجْعَلِ الْقُرْآنَ رَبِيعَ قَلْبِي، وَنُورَ صَدْرِي، وَجَلَاءَ حُزْنِي، وَذَهَابَ هَمِّي",
  "duaPourNousShare": "Share the application",
  "duaPourNousShareText": "Coran Karim — read, recite and memorise the Quran, with no ads.",
